# OneOS package set lineage23: sha256sum of out/overlays_lineage23_r1 (LineageOS 23.0, the MisterZtr VANILLA EXT4 GSI of 2026-01-09, Android 16 QPR0, sdk_full 36.0, BP2A.250805.005; the Galaxy A53 5G's own build), minus tethering_payload.img and cellbroadcast_payload.img (One UI's modules stay, as for LineageOS 24). No gmssystem payload: One UI's Google apps are laid over the guest's product partition at session time (guest_google.sh FULL mode). No ims-ext-common.jar and no telephonycore payload: the image has neither, and its bootanimation has none of the sites patch-bootanim-multidisplay.py needs, so LineageOS 24's set loses those three files. OneOSGuest.apk, OneOSPixelDoze.apk, samcam_a.tar and samcam_bar.tar are the shared builds.
